{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064143/block/singleImage/3269213/df/01M7KMTJEN5RDV8MXRW6RPCMG2.jpeg?updatedAt=1794882032\"/><figcaption>警元朗掃黃拘28內地女，最細17歲。(警方圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>元朗警區特別職務隊聯同相關部門人員昨日 (16 日 ) 於區內展開打擊非法賣淫活動行動。 行動中，人員共拘捕 28 名內地女子，年齡介乎 17 至 48 歲，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」。所有被捕女子現正被扣留調查。警方呼籲市民，若發現區內有懷疑非法活動，請與警方聯絡。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064143/block/singleImage/3269220/df/01M7KMVZPWJ55WFZ4Q2V07WEHM.jpeg?updatedAt=1794882032\"/><figcaption>警元朗掃黃拘28內地女，最細17歲。(警方圖片)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T03:47:52.579159+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T02:20:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T12:47:23.936036+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T03:41:00.587093+00:00","content_hash":"7fd134774f4518b1c5da3379a7391403b5cc23e00e8ff11051dd0f8e0cd01d63","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T03:47:52.579159+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}